 the prescribed path strangely you  will find God the refuge the rock when  you're willing to let go of some of the  certainties you thought most  foundational strangely you will find God  the goal when you let go of trying to  acquire God and allow God to acquire you  strangely you will find the church not  where there are numbers of people or  aesthetics or perfect doctrine but where  people honestly love each other and  their neighbors for Jesus sake you'll  find them and they'll find you amen
 

